{"recordId":"general_呂澤_306148953","name":"呂澤","type":"general","dynasty":"楚漢相爭","title":"漢軍隱柱","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"吕泽","pageId":5210652,"revisionId":93722656,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-01T02:36:45Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%95%E6%B3%BD","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93722656","wikidataId":"Q16176569","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"史记·高祖功臣侯者年表","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史记·高祖功臣侯者年表第六","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記 呂太后本紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"汉书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"史記/卷06","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B706","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:01.929Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:shiji","source:hanshu","source:yuanshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:shiji-c877a963c1df5e0c","query":"呂澤","count":1,"offset":2024,"excerpt":"入碭。漢王之解彭城，往從之，復發兵佐高祖定天下，功侯。\n三。六年正月丙戌，令武侯呂澤元年。四。九年，子台封酈侯元年。\n七\n\n建成。\n以呂后兄初起以客從，擊三秦。漢王入漢，而釋之還豐沛，奉衛呂宣王、太上皇。天下已平，封釋之爲建成侯。\n七。六年正月","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-75cf4bf34ea0d90c","query":"呂澤","count":4,"offset":3464,"excerpt":"者也。呂后恐，不知所為。人或謂呂后曰：「留侯善畫計筴，上信用之。」呂后乃使建成侯呂澤劫留侯，曰：「君常為上謀臣，今上欲易太子，君安得高枕而臥乎？」留侯曰：「始上數在困急之中，幸用臣筴。今天下安定，以愛欲易太子，骨肉之間，雖臣等百餘人何益。」呂澤","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-1880e70e55fa8252","query":"呂澤","count":4,"offset":3071,"excerpt":"得堅決也。呂后恐，不知所爲。或謂呂后曰：「留侯善畫計，上信用之。」呂后乃使建成侯呂澤劫良，曰：「君常爲上謀臣，今上日欲易太子，君安得髙枕而臥？」良曰：「始上數在急困之中，幸用臣策；今天下安定，以愛欲易太子，骨肉之間，雖臣等百人何益！」呂澤彊要曰","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-59497cdc6addfb96","query":"呂澤","count":1,"offset":11032,"excerpt":"，助要束木為惡，及同知上都留守司事，又受賕減諸從臣糧，詔籍其家貲、妻奴。復因潭州呂澤訴其刻虐，械送民獻至湖廣，如澤所訴窮治之。立海北海南道肅政廉訪司，治雷州。庚申，敕中書省，凡出征軍，毋以和顧和買煩其家。乙丑，太陰犯畢。乙卯，太陰犯井。戊辰，以","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-c877a963c1df5e0c","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷018","title":"史記/卷018","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7018","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=9484995","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7018?action=history","revisionId":9484995,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-11T14:16:36Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:02.353Z","sha256":"57b01ac1debb6bf8ed8a9ea42dbafc10fb2c8e022af15a86e416567513068e3d","textSha256":"9dfe9a9a5165715712c5180a7fb225c8ea3763ab4158a025399c55571fdb8a95","expandedWikitextSha256":"57b01ac1debb6bf8ed8a9ea42dbafc10fb2c8e022af15a86e416567513068e3d","characters":18419,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.081Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath"